omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PEYFXDlWwXcQ7kNvwETzDpd&_nc_oc=AdqkD8XC3urxtllpqFPmkT-sIGLiE-mCKl9vyHbomP7mjuBNF1kuC9Mq2Rwj9J9r8go&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1M3c6p7WiZcQ0alfQy3L93FBXhmYVW45ByTkmUgkj89g&oe=69DE2374"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4-QHqkAm2LIQ7kNvwH2KNR0&_nc_oc=AdpC1zzb27EAQVkZPpNOro30eNwt0QZYpokLDQ9jm7ZobGS8mctwn9wU0YxO0Oe8I0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3d9j6WMqyhraLBFKMYIXsxsOx7ypHmiLFqXHBITiVhzw&oe=69DE24D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yxc-VojiQ-MQ7kNvwFO4ZlX&_nc_oc=AdqC-4Q9LIjsei7oCcMvAh8aInCH6MmQ-aYBp0kLLSNiB627qhvVLKBrbq16BdfRgvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2WYZyMFpqJq_SxTiXl7WAbHw3LKegxltN7WxGkFoG7PQ&oe=69DE39F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://